slot. for Android: no blank flash at a Game Boy game's doors.
Pokemon Red, Blue and Yellow fade to black at each door, white the palette
out (or turn the screen off) while the next map loads, then show black
again: the blank screen flashed for six to eight frames. The frame before
stays (a dupe) while the screen is off and while the game's frame is all
one colour other than the one-colour frame before it, 12 frames at most.
The decision is made once the frame has run. One line in the log the
first times it happens.

